{"logId": "faf760cc-84b7-4a0e-bbed-9e0492d31b7e", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "自私——", "block_bbox": [168, 139, 264, 165], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[168.0, 139.0], [264.0, 139.0], [264.0, 165.0], [168.0, 165.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "害人害己的行为。", "block_bbox": [201, 179, 343, 202], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[201.00001525878906, 178.99998474121094], [342.0, 178.99998474121094], [342.0, 200.99998474121094], [201.00001525878906, 200.99998474121094]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "自卑——", "block_bbox": [165, 226, 262, 252], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 226.0], [262.0, 226.0], [262.0, 252.0], [165.0, 252.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "不尊重和敬畏自己的生命，浪费并践踏自己生命的行为。", "block_bbox": [202, 266, 647, 289], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[202.0, 266.0], [647.0, 266.0], [647.0, 289.0], [202.0, 289.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "贪婪——", "block_bbox": [165, 314, 262, 339], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 314.0], [262.0, 314.0], [262.0, 339.0], [165.0, 339.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "因为无知，让欲望大于能力，让幸福远离自己的行为。", "block_bbox": [201, 353, 629, 377], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 353.0], [629.0, 353.0], [629.0, 377.0], [201.0, 377.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "嫉妒——", "block_bbox": [164, 407, 262, 431], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[163.99996948242188, 407.0], [260.9999694824219, 407.0], [260.9999694824219, 430.0], [163.99996948242188, 430.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "否定自己，拿自己的短处和别人的长处对比，让自己精神痛苦甚至达到峰值的行为。", "block_bbox": [201, 446, 862, 470], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 446.0], [862.0, 446.0], [862.0, 470.0], [201.0, 470.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "束缚——", "block_bbox": [165, 499, 262, 524], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 499.0], [262.0, 499.0], [262.0, 524.0], [165.0, 524.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "违背自由，痛苦的根源，对人性、精神、灵魂、道德和行为绑架的行为。", "block_bbox": [201, 540, 773, 564], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 540.0], [773.0, 540.0], [773.0, 564.0], [201.0, 564.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "伤害——", "block_bbox": [165, 583, 262, 609], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 583.0], [262.0, 583.0], [262.0, 609.0], [165.0, 609.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "迷失人性，不懂得尊重自己和保护自己，不懂得尊重他人和保护他人。伤害他人，其实更伤害自己，也伤害社会……是最无知、最愚昧、最不值得的行为。", "block_bbox": [163, 624, 1005, 677], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[163.0, 624.0], [1005.0, 624.0], [1005.0, 677.0], [163.0, 677.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[10]", "block_bbox": [574, 717, 611, 738], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[574.0, 717.0], [610.0, 717.0], [610.0, 737.0], [574.0, 737.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "幸福生命状态考评奖励方案", "block_bbox": [206, 901, 726, 947], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "gro